   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/f9d5d3978d071/Capture2.PNG?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Capture2.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Dear All, </font><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I’m using GGIR to process 7-day Actigraph data. The measurement didn’t start at midnight, but during the day (i.e., started on Wednesday at 8pm, and stopped next Wednesday at 5pm). However, the visual showed the first night of sleep was 0.1 hr. </span>Does somebody know why this happens?<br></font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">here is my script:</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Part 2 parameters:</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">#-------------------------------</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">strategy = 1,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">hrs.del.start = 0,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">hrs.del.end = 0,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">maxdur = 0,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">includedaycrit = 10, </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">L5M5window = c(0,24), </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">M5L5res = 10, </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">winhr = c(5), </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">qlevels = c(c(1380/1440),c(1410/1440),c(1438/1440)), </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">qwindow=c(0,24), </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">ilevels = c(seq(0,400,by=50),8000),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">iglevels = TRUE,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">mvpathreshold =c(100.6), </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">#-------------------------------</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Part 3 parameters:</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">#-------------------------------</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">timethreshold= c(5), </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">anglethreshold=5, </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">ignorenonwear = TRUE,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">#-------------------------------</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Part 4 parameters:</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">#-------------------------------</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">excludefirstlast = FALSE, </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">includenightcrit = 10, </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">def.noc.sleep = c(1),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">loglocation= c(),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">outliers.only = FALSE,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">relyonsleeplog = FALSE,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">do.visual = TRUE,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">criterror = 4,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">#-------------------------------</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Part 5 parameters:</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">#-------------------------------</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Key functions: Merging physical activity with sleep analyses</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">threshold.lig = c(44.8),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">threshold.mod = c(100.6),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">threshold.vig = c(428.8),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">excludefirstlast = FALSE,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">boutcriter = 0.8,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"http://boutcriter.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://boutcriter.in&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792491035063000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0yG1ctsYl3KSYr9J6XQ1ZF\">boutcriter.in</a> = 0.9,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">boutcriter.lig = 0.8,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">boutcriter.mvpa = 0.8,</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"http://boutdur.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://boutdur.in&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792491035063000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_HJ1RMu4UwJXf1Z7eN6UH\">boutdur.in</a> = c(10,20,30),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">boutdur.lig = c(1,5,10),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">boutdur.mvpa = c(1,5,10),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">timewindow = c(&quot;WW&quot;),</font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Thanks in adance. </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Best, </font></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">N</font></p></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
